		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead, skinless hulk that skins still-living victims. Can wear skins, transforming into the shape of the skinned foe.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +7 (2d6 + skin), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Skin</strong>. If ecorche hits the same target with both claws, CON 15+ or tear target's skin off. If skinned, lose 1 CON permanently per round until magically healed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wear Skin</strong>. Instead of attacks, can don a mortal's skin, changing shape into the mortal's form.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
